  "local_changes": [
    "backend/dx12/ffx_dx12.cpp: OWN_FI_NO_PIX build option",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/internal/ffx_frameinterpolation.cpp: the reconstruct-previous-depth dispatch is not scheduled, the game motion vector field pass does its depth splat; the setup pass's five zeroed images are cleared and the pass runs one group, for its counters; the inpainting pass runs a sixteenth of the groups where it can, and with a 16-bit HUD-less image it keeps the source itself and the dispatch-end copy is not scheduled",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation_game_motion_vector_field.h: the field and depth atomics load their cell first and are taken only where they can still change it; the depth splat of the reconstruct-previous-depth pass runs in this pass; the distortion lookup is the constant zero",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation_reconstruct_dilated_velocity_and_previous_depth.h: the depth atomic loads its cell first and is taken only where the depth is nearer",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation_reconstruct_previous_depth.h: the depth atomic loads its cell first and is taken only where the depth is nearer; the distortion lookup is the constant zero",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/internal/shaders/ffx_frameinterpolation_game_motion_vector_field_pass.hlsl: the estimated depth of the generated frame is bound to the game motion vector field pass for writing",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation_disocclusion_mask.h: the distortion lookups, one per depth read, are the constant zero",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/internal/ffx_opticalflow.cpp: the filter pass is dispatched for level 0 alone, the scale pass filters what it reads and reads the search's own result; a reset clears no longer the fourteen luminance images, which are written whole before anything reads them",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/opticalflow/ffx_opticalflow_scale_optical_flow_advanced_v5.h: the scale pass computes the filter of what it reads itself, by the filter pass's own arithmetic",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/opticalflow/ffx_opticalflow_compute_optical_flow_v5.h: the plain-arithmetic search runs a group's four blocks at once, a thread computing a whole search row, its sums by the minimum, its windows loaded by gathers where they lie inside the picture; taken only where a wave is 32 or 64 lanes, AMD's path untouched otherwise and in the msad4 variant",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/internal/shaders/ffx_frameinterpolation_inpainting_pass.hlsl: one thread for 4 by 4 pixels calling the function only for a pixel it can change, and with a 16-bit HUD-less image storing it for the next pair (bit 30 of the dispatch flags)",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation_callbacks_hlsl.h: the previous interpolation source is declared for a pass that writes it",
    "framegeneration/fsr3/include/gpu/frameinterpolation/ffx_frameinterpolation.h: the interpolation samples the two pictures once where optical flow's vector is the game's",
    "api/internal/ffx_provider.h: the driver-side provider slot the 2.4.0 public sources reference but do not define is defined as never valid; this library links its own provider alone"
  ],
